<title>BULGARIA: FRANKFURT FIXINGS FOR AUGUST 5.</title>
<headline>FRANKFURT FIXINGS FOR AUGUST 5.</headline>
<dateline>SOFIA 1997-08-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The dollar was fixed at 1.8815</p>
<p>marks in Frankfurt on Tuesday from 1.8720 marks on Monday.</p>
<p>Other main currencies are fixed against the mark at the</p>
<p>following rates (previous in brackets):</p>
<p>    USD   1.8815 (1.8720)	</p>
<p>    GBP   3.0615 (3.0460)	</p>
<p>    CHF 122.5700 (121.9600)    </p>
<p>    JPY   1.5894 (1.5774)	</p>
<p>    ATS  14.2110 (14.2110)     </p>
<p>The exchange rates are used in Bulgaria for accounting,</p>
<p>statistical and customs purposes and are valid for Wednesday,</p>
<p>August 6.</p>
<p>-- Sofia Newsroom, (++359-2) 911 88</p>
</text>
